      "body": "The projected balance at retirement ranges from $931,045 to $1,720,487, compared with a target of $1,974,359. This is a planning estimate, not a guarantee; it assumes real returns after fees of 1.95% to 5.95%, $23,500 in yearly contributions, and a 3.9% withdrawal rate. Pre-tax accounts are reduced by a flat 15% tax in the estimate.",
